# Command: Development Frontend Web

## Purpose

Start the React SPA with Vite HMR.

## Prerequisites

- Node.js **24.16.0** (`nvm use` at repo root)
- API running (see `.cursor/commands/dev-api.mdc`)
- `CORS_ORIGINS` in `api/.env` includes `http://localhost:5173`
- `web/.env` with `VITE_API_URL` (default `http://localhost:3000/api`)

## Execution

```bash
nvm use
cd web && npm run dev
```

| Resource | URL |
| -------- | --- |
| App | `http://localhost:5173` |
| Login | `http://localhost:5173/login` |

## Test credentials

See root `README.md` or `api/README.md` seed table (`admin@dnamusic.co` / `Admin123!`).

## Quality checks (before push)

```bash
cd web && npm run lint && npm run build
```

